From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joeri Van Dooren <ure@on6ure.be>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:28:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Tests: the fake reflector plays talkers and audio, and
 runs as a program

FR_SCRIPT: after the login, TCP and UDP heartbeats, and what fr_send() asks
for: a talker's start and stop, a tone as Opus audio and its flush, an error,
the connection closed. What the client does (its talkgroup, the set it
monitors, an over it sent) is told to a report callback. tests/fakerefl_main.c
runs it as build/fakerefl (make fakerefl), for the tests of a front end that
runs svxconnect --stdio as its helper.
---
